    },
    {
      "headline": "Siliņa attends informal EU Council summit in Cyprus after bilateral meeting with Greek PM",
      "summary": "PM Evika Siliņa visited Athens on April 23 for bilateral talks with Greek PM Kyriakos Mitsotakis, then participated in an informal European Council meeting in Cyprus (April 23–24) chaired by European Council President António Costa. At the summit she stressed EU support for Ukraine, called for measures to address the economic fallout from the Iran conflict including possible ETS payment deferrals, and welcomed the EU's approval of a €90bn loan to Ukraine."
    },
    {
      "headline": "Saeima approves €30m airBaltic loan amid coalition tensions; Estonia declines stake",
